SUMMARY:2026 returns due: claim the 2026 adoption credit on Form 8839
DESCRIPTION:Up to $17\,670 per child for 2026\, with up to $5\,120 refund
 able. The credit phases out between $265\,080 and $305\,080 of modified A
 GI.\n\nDetails: https://mfa-advisory.com/blog/adoption-tax-credit-refund-
 2026/\nGeneral information\, not tax advice. Merchant Financial Advisory\
